Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.29,0:00:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.27,0:00:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.69,0:00:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.63,0:00:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.53,0:01:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.23,0:01:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.35,0:01:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.91,0:01:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.11,0:01:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.70,0:02:02.12,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(479,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,800)}Captain Kuro of\Na Thousand Plans
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.70,0:02:02.12,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(479,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(720,800)}Captain Kuro of\Na Thousand Plans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.13,0:01:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Sorcery!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's a freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.75,0:02:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A magical freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sent Captain Kaido fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got treasure to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use our pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.67,0:02:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say your prayers, butler! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.55,0:02:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.65,0:02:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Game over, you lousy,\NNewgate pirate! No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those kids! What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those Rugrats have a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time we'll let you off\Nwithout any more brutality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now those stupid kids have really done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.19,0:03:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro is going to be so mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gosh, that is so totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought there were no\Nsecrets between us pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.19,0:03:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to tell each other\Neverything. Care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys got to get out of here run
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stand and fight\Nwith you. Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates will be shamed if we run in fear
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite a strange technique\Nyou've developed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have powers from\Neating the Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.16,0:04:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a rubber man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ate the Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.75,0:04:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those Devil Fruit people are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got rubber arms, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes perfect sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't just hallucinate his\Narm stretching out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.77,0:04:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.60,0:04:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can handle the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You take care of Miss\NKaya like we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have her ride her butler into her will?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.87,0:04:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the kids, they're an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:04:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to get to them, you'll\Nhave to make it through me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geek!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star-sipper!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.19,0:05:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy he's crazy... Oh no, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:05:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no stay away from
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her no don't no
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.27,0:06:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we're not running.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not after they did this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will avenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.81,0:06:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't argue with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you the most important\Ntask there is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely critical that you succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take Kaya and get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the reason we\Nwanted to be pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To protect what's dear to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.95,0:06:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:06:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a direct order. Yes! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaya, hurry! This way! Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure got away with words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made running away sound brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.11,0:07:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know these words like\Nthe back of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.25,0:07:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.55,0:07:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry, I was gawking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fools, do they really\Nthink that they can escape me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.23,0:07:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a priority right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their attempt at escape is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know all too well how weak Kaya is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no way they can\Npossibly escape Jango.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.77,0:07:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you want to help her, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.57,0:08:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, you'll have to get\Noff this hill alive, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess losing to me once\Nwasn't enough for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to get out of my\Nway, you fooling tub of a lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm blown!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey, is that weird\Nhypnotist guy still behind us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.55,0:09:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make sure and lose it for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that nutjob could\Ncatch up to us in our own forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.31,0:09:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Oshoff pirates are going\Nto keep you safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Oshoff pirates stand by their word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they're not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bulls, I'm coming to get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think you can run from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:09:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could do this the easy way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or I could just level this entire forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that guy is really mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he can do a lot more\Nthan just hypnotize people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where have you gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the sound of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jungo's probably tearing the place apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See for yourself if you can get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heartless bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you even have a shred of pity you\Nlived with that girl for three years?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I've told you Kaya is nothing\Nmore than a pawn in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend to win when she's dead,\Nthen I'll be grateful to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.23,0:11:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is hopelessly evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should put him out of his misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.47,0:11:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go find the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.45,0:11:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.27,0:11:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, very impressive. You can still move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You betrayed the villagers'\Ntrust not to mention
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you plan to take the life\Nof a sweet young girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the last time\Nyou ever get your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.27,0:11:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.89,0:12:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay on the ground there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you did somehow catch up to Jango,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'd end your life in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Staying there is what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.29,0:12:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care that I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm captain of the Usopp Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brave warrior of the sea who\Nfights for what he holds dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will protect everyone in\Nthe village if it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On my word, you will never\Nset foot in that village!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.95,0:12:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's yelling about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, he's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, me and Usopp are going\Nto chase down that hypno-freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem? No. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be a whole lot faster\Nif I was going by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.77,0:13:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know those woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if we're going to catch up to\Nthem, I'm going to need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.99,0:13:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who gave you permission\Nto go anywhere? I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.41,0:13:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss, Zoro, get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.73,0:13:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have another!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gums!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, he disappeared again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.89,0:14:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the most important thing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I kill you, I\Nfeel compelled to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is an outsider like you budding\Ninto this village's business for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because there's a man in this\Nvillage that I don't want to let die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple enough are you okay with\Nthat being the reason that you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is quite boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cocky jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go east.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I said go east, so go east already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, east.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that left or right? Turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.41,0:15:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's where we came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms. Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.21,0:15:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're under strict orders to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got a really bad fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Kaya. A doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's trying to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's dangerous for her to run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.21,0:15:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show yourselves, you ruts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the thought is more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you brats go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.03,0:16:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we left Kaya and ran away right\Nnow, we would probably survive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And our captain always\Nsaid to run with your tail
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between your legs if you\Nthink you're gonna lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.59,0:16:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again our captain is a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.07,0:16:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even he didn't take\Nhis own advice he tried
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so hard to protect us he\Nrisked his life for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swore to protect Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.37,0:16:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then prepare\Nyourselves to stop pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it! Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no match for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't put your life\Non the line for my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't want to die, we\Nhave to fight for our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He nicked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuro laid him out flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lot of good that Devil Fruit did him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Captain Kuro for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.95,0:16:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole plan was devised so that I\Nmay be rid of that name once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.43,0:17:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Concocting plans every day for a bunch of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,barbarians who care only\Nabout havoc and mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relentlessly attacked by\Ngovernment dogs and bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sick and tired of\Nthat entire cursed life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.52,0:17:43.40,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,85)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)}Kuro of a Thousand Plans\N(3 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.52,0:17:43.40,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,85)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Kuro of a Thousand Plans\N(3 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 3,0:17:38.52,0:17:43.40,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,85)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Kuro of a Thousand Plans\N(3 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the third time this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.23,0:17:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, can you really blame them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of the most famous\Npirates sailing the seas right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro is a superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My infamy is what draws them to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:18:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm giving\Nup being Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, wouldn't that be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.93,0:18:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except, the marines won't stop their\Npursuit until Captain Kuro is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem that the tumultuous\Nlife of a pirate just isn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't quit, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ship's captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can be captain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.89,0:18:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have finally grown weary of this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.73,0:18:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm killing myself for all to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir! Captain Kuro! Captain! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.77,0:18:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many vessels are there? One!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do, captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we man the cannons?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can blast them to splinters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lower a small boat into the\Nwater. What? A boat! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:19:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Captain Django, Captain Kuro\Njust... Yeah, I know. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for him\Nto go there by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's turning himself in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cannon fire stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to board the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.35,0:19:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, shouldn't we...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.03,0:19:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an order. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better get ready for a fight, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why you... On three!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.63,0:19:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.85,0:19:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, then, let's begin this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.57,0:20:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kind enough to let\Nyou and you alone survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not kneeling to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.75,0:20:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish me off and get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.51,0:20:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can still howl this much with\Na shattered jaw, you should do fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is the greatest day of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.85,0:20:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is the day you\Ncaptured Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be ever so grateful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.29,0:20:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you the head of Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name is Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name is Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This atrocity was your doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.67,0:20:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Django.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.89,0:21:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This atrocity was my doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.85,0:21:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you are the brave marine who\Ncaught the infamous Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return to base and see\Nthat he gets executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.27,0:21:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Django.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the brave marine who caught\Nthe infamous Captain Kuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.97,0:21:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing it again, Vice Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.37,0:21:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my double gets executed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro will disappear from the\NEarth, and I will live the life I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.25,0:21:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when my plan succeeds today,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after three years of planning,\Nrevising, and waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my goal will be achieved in its entirety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.83,0:21:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wealth and peace of mind\Nwill finally be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not allow this perfect\Nplan years in the making to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.31,0:21:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plan will not be disrupted\Nby an urchin like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.21,0:22:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem that you can do\Na lot more than just stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.71,0:22:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.62,0:22:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been toughening\Nmyself up to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.99,0:22:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what don't want a reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.69,0:22:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then don't be a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.21,0:22:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just greedy, Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.63,0:22:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have ambition!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.27,0:22:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.95,0:22:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Searching for a great treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.57,0:22:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a map in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.35,0:22:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I knew would leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.03,0:22:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find my way to that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.13,0:22:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before someone could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.03,0:22:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.21,0:23:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.99,0:23:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.67,0:23:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.03,0:23:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.73,0:23:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever\Nchanges, I call out your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.57,0:23:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We return to the time when\Neverything's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.91,0:23:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

